  "description": "Strongly-typed Avalonia theming. Derive a class from Theme, mark it [Theme], and include it in App.axaml as <YourTheme />. Every public token becomes a {color:...}, {size:...} or {theme:...} markup extension with IntelliSense; [ColorRamp] seeds expand into full light and dark ramps, [AccentHue] colors become hues any control can pick with theme:Accent.Kind, [AccentRole] names the stage each part uses, and [SizeScale] builds size ladders from one BaseSize. The theme loads every control theme and styles file in its project, edits to [Observable] tokens restyle the app live, and theme:ThemeRegion.IsDark renders any subtree in the dark or light palette from the same theme.",
